## Validation Reference

### Validation Objective

Demonstrate that providing adaptive vehicle intelligence enables the Adaptive Vehicle Intelligence Architecture (AVIA) to fulfill its intended operational purpose.

---

### Validation Method

Validation shall be performed through:

| Method | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| Operational Evaluation | Assess the system in representative operational environments. |
| Scenario-Based Assessment | Confirm appropriate adaptation across diverse operating scenarios. |
| Stakeholder Acceptance | Demonstrate that the delivered capability satisfies approved engineering and operational expectations. |

---

### Validation Reference

Detailed validation plans, operational scenarios, and acceptance records shall be maintained within the AVIA Validation domain and referenced from this objective.

---

### Validation Success Criteria

Validation shall demonstrate that the system:

- Adapts appropriately to changing operational conditions.
- Supports safe and effective vehicle operation.
- Achieves the intended functional capability defined by this objective.
- Meets the expectations established by the Project Charter and System Objective Specification.

---

